First the grumble, I'm sure it's already been voiced : wielding an object
you have several of results in you wielding ALL of them. 2 I could believe,
but "you are wielding 11 +4 daggers"??
The first level is now so hazardous, a lot of beginners may be put off
by the sheer difficulty of merely surviving. I fancy you may have made
the Wiz a little TOO puny.. 
Now the constructive bit, another suggestion.
Anyone who survives long will play a good game over several days, and
be annoyed at being unable to recall where they left that +3 plate mail
when they got their (now destroyed) crystal plate. - or whatever.
How's about equipping our intrepid adventurers with a NOTEBOOK (and pencil!)
or a diary. Standard issue to all classes please, even the barbarian can
draw pictures. It would have to rot in a bones file I guess, since it would
relate to a different set of dungeons.

All in all, a great game made considerably more interesting. Very well done!

Dave E.


